<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #E8E8E8; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  A user with a verified email on your team's domain has requested to
  join <strong>{{accountName}}</strong>. They can't access anything
  until you approve.
</p>

<table
  role="presentation"
  cellspacing="0"
  cellpadding="0"
  border="0"
  width="100%"
>
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding: 8px 0 24px;">
      <a
        href="{{reviewUrl}}"
        style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4A90E2; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2px;"
      >
        Review request
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 24px 0 0; color: #808080; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
  Approving creates a member-level seat. Denying is silent — the
  requester is not told who approved or denied. Anyone who shouldn't be
  on this domain can be removed at any time from the team settings.
</p>
